Thank you for all the  background information. You are certainly involved i=
n many interesting projects !

Yesterday Bo called me and told me that the new version 4.0 has now been of=
ficially put on the IBOS homepage.

So I suggest that you download it from there and install it just as if you =
were normal Dutch users.

As you know only the program itself and the User=E2=80=99s guide is in Dutc=
h, so you will have to use
english versions of the homepage, the Installation Manual and the Release N=
otes.

IBOS will probably apply for fonding to continue the project. If you=E2=80=
=99ve got the time I suggest
that you contact Bo (cc to this mail). Maybe you could supply him with your=
 experience
about the program, details about how you use it and suggestions for further=
 development ?
Or even a translation to Dutch of the english text on the IBOS homepage so =
IBOS could 
make a special Dutch variant of the homepage too. 

If we one day can continue the project with a version 5 I hope you will ass=
ist by updating
the translation files (the spreadsheets) and the User=E2=80=99s manual.

Best regards

Jens


