Hi Jens,

 

Ofcourse you may use our photo=E2=80=99s! You also may use our familyname D=
e Leeuw, so Bert and Corine de Leeuw and guidedog Vikas.

 

Bert and I are not retired. Bert works at the municipality for recicling en=
vironment. He is 60 years old.

I am 53 years old and i work as a teacher for an organisation Counselling N=
etherlands www.counsellingnet.nl.

Further i work as a volentier teacher NT2, that means Netherlands as second=
 language. In this organisation we have about 50 volentiers. I have two kin=
d of groups. The first is a group of women who know a very little bit of du=
tch. Their own languages are very different. So they come to learn dutch. M=
y other group comest to be more secure in life and they are searching for w=
ork. My collegue Anne and I try to help them to make good leeters applying =
for a job, and we eexcersize with conversations when they are talking with =
their employers. And ofcouse we use counselling.

Further Bert and i work as volentiers for an organisation that represents t=
he interests of therapists who work with APS. You can reed about APS in Eng=
lish on www.apstherapy.com.

 

As you already know my biggest hobby is playing flute. My teacher is the fa=
mous Berdien Stenberg.

I already have three diplomes of the musicschool with high notes. I hope to=
 present my theses this june. It is about braille scores and spoken scores.=
 I also write in my theses about your IBOS XML-muzieklezer.

Next year I hope to do my practise exam and than i finished the musischool.=
 I hope to play Maya from Ian Clarke, Andante K315 of Mozart, La flute de p=
an of Mouquet, Fantasia 6 of Telemann, Affectueuse of Claude Bolling on Alt=
 flute and maybe also Hypnoses of Ian Clarke. So i am excersizing nearly ev=
eryday for about 90 minutes. I have once in a month a lesson at Almere give=
n by Berdien Stenberg. 

 

As soon as we have created out website and we can put a link on it to IBOS =
we will contact you.

It will take some time, but we have many days to come this year! 

 

We hope you can stay at IBOS for it is fantastic work you do and here in Ho=
lland, as i already told you, you must pay for every score in braille =E2=
=82=AC4,95 and you also must wait until the library Dedicon has time for yo=
u.

 

Now i must have my diner, so till next time!

 

Greetings for you and Bo,

 

Corine, Bert and Vikas

 

