ople don't know what keyboard shortcuts are, perhaps they think a Yamaha ke=
yboard or a digital piano is meant). 

  Some knowledge of the functionality of the program is very helpful, if yo=
u want to translate properly. 

  Further a basic knowledge on music is necessary. If you don't know that t=
he key in music is not something to open the door, but a musical notation: =
it will be very difficult to translate.

   

  We are very curious about the presentation of Bo. What kind of audience h=
e is speaking for? 

   

  Is the IBOS XML-muzieklezer work your job or are you a volunteer like Cor=
ine and me?

   

  Corine and I have the intention to build a non-commercial website, where =
people can download for free the files we made (I reading the notes for the=
 flute). If allowed we will place a link to the site of the IBOS organisati=
on, so people can download the IBOS XML-muzieklezer programm.  But we wil s=
tart with the audio-files we made ourselves with the voicerecorder.

   

  We keep in contact.

   

  Greetings from Corine, Vikas and Bert

   

   

   

