e.

  But as I once bought the MuseScore Android App for about 2 Euros I still =
have free access so I haven't experienced it by myself !

   

  Now I'm off for IBOS where I'll spend the day putting all the bits and pi=
eces for the release together.

   

  You have certainly found the magic words for this project: "good enough".=
  

  The release will contain many known programming errors and missing functi=
onality that you and other users have asked for!

  But I also hope that the program is also "good enough" =E2=80=93 otherwis=
e it would never be released with our limited resources.

   

  Another thing: Can you give me an estimate of how many hours of work you =
